---
Show the current account, your profiles and setup checks

Usage: vendo workspace [OPTIONS]

Options:
      --json  Output raw JSON
  -h, --help  Print help

Global options:
      --profile <name>  Use a specific account profile (or set VENDO_PROFILE)
      --debug           Enable verbose request diagnostics

Examples:
  $ vendo workspace
  $ vendo workspace --json
